{
  "CONVERSATION": [
    {
      "content": "创建一个两层住宅，但我还不知道楼梯位置、墙厚、楼板厚度和门窗尺寸。",
      "question_ids": [],
      "role": "user",
      "turn_id": "turn-user-001"
    },
    {
      "content": "墙厚和楼板厚度分别是多少？",
      "question_ids": [
        "q-wall-slab-thickness"
      ],
      "role": "assistant",
      "turn_id": "turn-assistant-002"
    },
    {
      "content": "楼梯计划放在什么位置？",
      "question_ids": [
        "q-stair-location"
      ],
      "role": "assistant",
      "turn_id": "turn-assistant-003"
    },
    {
      "content": "门窗的尺寸是多少？请分别说明门和窗的宽度、高度，以及窗台高（如有）。",
      "question_ids": [
        "q-opening-dimensions"
      ],
      "role": "assistant",
      "turn_id": "turn-assistant-004"
    },
    {
      "content": "墙厚为 200 mm。",
      "question_ids": [
        "q-wall-slab-thickness",
        "q-stair-location",
        "q-opening-dimensions"
      ],
      "role": "user",
      "turn_id": "turn-user-005"
    }
  ],
